 of Goldnight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-06-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=She%20was%20surrounded%2C%20backed,and%20Rembert%20before%20her","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Archmage of Goldnight\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jun 2016."}},{"id":"archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08-e31","era":null,"summary":"The mad angel seizes Rembert and carries him into the air.","participants":["archmage-rembert","cathars"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"major","page":"stories/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","order":513,"story_date":"2016-06-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":154,"quote":"The angel shrieked as it closed its bloody fingers around Rembert's arms and pulled him, gasping and wide-eyed, into the air.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=The%20angel%20shrieked%20as,wide%2Deyed%2C%20into%20the%20air.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Archmage of Goldnight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-06-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=The%20angel%20shrieked%20as,wide%2Deyed%2C%20into%20the%20air.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Archmage of Goldnight\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jun 2016."}},{"id":"archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08-e32","era":null,"summary":"Arlinn leaps up, pulls the angel to the ground and kills her, freeing Rembert.","participants":["arlinn-kord","archmage-rembert"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"major","page":"stories/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","order":513,"story_date